  "description": "Subject: Traffic Signal Cycle Configuration \u2013 Version\u202f1.3.5  \n\nThe current signal timing configuration (version\u202f1.3.5) is defined for a 120\u2011second control period and supports two independent control systems.  \n\nCycle **C01** (sequence\u202f1, cycle\u202f1) is marked as valid (valid\u202f=\u202f1) with no errors (err\u202f=\u202f0), no transmission failures (trans\u202f=\u202f0), and no offset correction applied (offcor\u202f=\u202f0). The timestamp recorded for this cycle is **1627849200** (UTC epoch). It reports standard deviation\u202f=\u202f0, geographic flag\u202f=\u202f0, and is associated with node\u202f10. The send status returned \u201cOK\u201d (errno\u202f=\u202f0) and the cycle belongs to system\u202f**A**.  \nThe green phases for C01 are:  \n- **G1** \u2013 green time\u202f=\u202f30\u202fs, pedestrian interval\u202f=\u202f5\u202fs, total time\u202f=\u202f45\u202fs, gap\u202f=\u202f2\u202fs, maximum green\u202f=\u202f60\u202fs, foot\u2011off\u202f=\u202f1.  \n- **G2** \u2013 green time\u202f=\u202f25\u202fs, pedestrian interval\u202f=\u202f4\u202fs, total time\u202f=\u202f40\u202fs, gap\u202f=\u202f3\u202fs, maximum green\u202f=\u202f55\u202fs, foot\u2011off\u202f=\u202f0.  \n\nCycle **C02** (sequence\u202f2, cycle\u202f2) is also valid (valid\u202f=\u202f1) with zero errors (err\u202f=\u202f0), zero transmission issues (trans\u202f=\u202f0) and no offset correction (offcor\u202f=\u202f0). Its recorded timestamp is **1627849260**. Standard deviation and geographic flag are both 0, and the cycle is tied to node\u202f11. The send status is \u201cOK\u201d (errno\u202f=\u202f0) and the cycle is assigned to system\u202f**B**.  \nThe single green phase for C02 is:  \n- **G3** \u2013 green time\u202f=\u202f35\u202fs, pedestrian interval\u202f=\u202f6\u202fs, total time\u202f=\u202f50\u202fs, gap\u202f=\u202f1\u202fs, maximum green\u202f=\u202f65\u202fs, foot\u2011off\u202f=\u202f1.",
